{
  "uid": "slo-reference",
  "title": "SLO dashboard: reference solution",
  "tags": [
    "aidc",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability (1h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 99.0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (sum(rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\",code=~\"5..\"}[1h])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[1h])), 1e-9))"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Are we keeping the promise we published, this hour?"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "e2e p95 (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(aidc_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How does the service feel right now, at the tail a user notices?"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / min",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[5m])) * 60"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How much traffic are we actually carrying?"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[5m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How wrong are we going, right now?"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency percentiles",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(aidc_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(aidc_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(aidc_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Is the whole latency distribution moving, or only its tail?"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Traffic by status",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(aidc_requests_total{route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{code}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "What is the traffic made of, and when did that change?"
    }
  ],
  "description": "Reference solution for W5D1, not the artifact you submit: build your own and save it as 'Team SLOs'. Tier-0 exprs over the app's aidc_* series. Tier 1: swap to vLLM's vllm: families (vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket, vllm:request_success_total, vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:gpu_cache_usage_perc) for the same panel shapes. Keep the colons: Prometheus stores the name vLLM publishes, so the underscore spellings return no data and draw as empty panels."
}
